Package: pandasGWASr
Type: Package
Title: Programmatic Access to GWAS Catalog REST API V2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Tianze", "Cao",
      email = "hnrcao@qq.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: An R client providing programmatic access to the
    NHGRI-EBI GWAS Catalog RESTful API version 2. The package offers a
    unified interface for querying GWAS Catalog data, including
    associations, studies, traits, variants, publications, genes,
    ancestries, loci, genomic contexts and summary statistics, with
    built-in response caching, automatic pagination and Fat/Thin
    response modes. Results are returned as S4 data objects supporting
    position and identifier indexing as well as set operations through
    the +, -, &, |, ^ and == operators.
URL: https://github.com/TianzeLab/pandasGWASr
BugReports: https://github.com/TianzeLab/pandasGWASr/issues
